WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
A red mass of Lunar Cry creatures plummets through the clouds toward the planet below.

2
00:07.000 --> 00:13.000
Looking up from Esthar, the sky turns solid red. Lunatic Pandora looms overhead.

3
00:14.000 --> 00:20.000
Golden streaks rain down between green mountains as the cascade strikes the continent.

4
00:21.000 --> 00:28.000
From the ground, fiery trails pour from the darkened sky in every direction.

5
00:29.000 --> 00:35.000
The Lunar Cry slams into the surface. A blinding golden explosion erupts from the impact.

6
00:36.000 --> 00:41.000
Inside Lunatic Pandora, radiant energy bursts outward from the core.
